{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2026-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1767225600, "end_date": 1767916799, "month_true_total": 184, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:54:26 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "215515017", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070252352", "personaname": "VValter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/JealousKid/", "num_games_owned": 609, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 4471, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3493, "last_played": 1768096805, "avatar": "9ffe05ea1d59aebd271b7101cae53fb2386e7886"}, "language": "english", "review": "very nise", "timestamp_created": 1767909563, "timestamp_updated": 1767909563, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215495868", "author": {"steamid": "76561198152361024", "personaname": "Negan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thelethalvirus/", "num_games_owned": 848, "num_reviews": 86, "playtime_forever": 102103, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2023, "playtime_at_review": 193, "last_played": 1788058734, "avatar": "3989885674a89c936808f2df1a4dd9b817b9164a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Back 4 Blood is the spiritual successor to Left 4 Dead 2, and I feel this every time I play it. While the pressure is on its shoulders to deliver a title as memorable as L4D2 (many people still play it 15+ years later) is really high, I feel like B4B pretty much delivers what it's supposed to: an addictive game experience even in single-player mode. Definitely grab the standard version when it goes on sale and when it comes to the DLCs, they are way too expensive in my opinion, so maybe keep an eye out for them when they are discounted.", "timestamp_created": 1767892755, "timestamp_updated": 1767892755, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504035353660583496", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215484680", "author": {"steamid": "76561198153712013", "personaname": "Nexedail", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198153712013/", "num_games_owned": 257, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 210, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 127, "last_played": 1767975082, "avatar": "420c30fa43bce9052d5ddfee2a50f92cc5ecc751"}, "language": "english", "review": "Take four or so L4D developers, recycle all the bad ideas that Valve discarded from both L4D1 and L4D2 for very good reasons, and finally recycle even the beta name of L4D2.\nThe result is a game that shows the world that L4D owes much of its success to Valve and its tweaks.", "timestamp_created": 1767883066, "timestamp_updated": 1767883066, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522497177124023438", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215454787", "author": {"steamid": "76561199550055305", "personaname": "CruzadoTático", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199550055305/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 11915, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11457, "last_played": 1769798913, "avatar": "2df804362273c308114d647252536403d0c7b041"}, "language": "english", "review": "it has issues but still fun. The swarm mode is dead so i cant platinum the game :(", "timestamp_created": 1767844699, "timestamp_updated": 1769738192, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215454700", "author": {"steamid": "76561198316863424", "personaname": "kowın", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kowinL4D/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 2781, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1523, "last_played": 1768302216, "avatar": "d4e51787fe0b3380db0ed69e0ac6de29d07b8e54"}, "language": "english", "review": "<3 Mom !", "timestamp_created": 1767844603, "timestamp_updated": 1767844603, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}